  "prefLabel": "Plc 2102.03 Mediation",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 2102.03 “Mediation” means a voluntary, non-binding process using a neutral third party to help the parties reach a mutually-acceptable resolution of their dispute.\n\nSource. #14331, eff 8-20-25, EXPIRES: 8-20-35",
